---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
import Icon from '../components/Icon.astro';
import SiteHeader from '../components/SiteHeader.astro';
import SiteFooter from '../components/SiteFooter.astro';
import MethodCaseStudies from '../components/MethodCaseStudies.astro';
import { withBase } from '../lib/url';
---

<Base
  title="Engineering Evidence & Its Limits | Mrityunjay Kumar"
  description="Independent studies of layout contracts, publication disclosure, and generated formal feedback. Methods, bounded findings, and limits of the evidence."
  canonicalPath="/method.html"
>
  <SiteHeader homeHref={withBase('/')} />
  <main id="main" class="article-shell">
    <div class="article-head">
      <p class="article-kicker">Independent research · Three studies</p>
      <h1 id="method-title" class="article-title">What does the evidence establish?</h1>
      <p class="article-byline">By <a href={withBase('/')}>Mrityunjay Kumar</a></p>
      <p class="article-deck">A passing test, a checked model, and a working browser artifact answer different questions. These studies examine the boundaries between them.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="article-body">
      <p>Layout contracts ask what an item-local rule can certify. Disclosure contracts compare a publication policy with emitted files. Generated formal feedback asks whether a more expensive repair process adds value over an ordinary search.</p>
      <p>These are independent research studies, not accounts of deployed employer systems. Their conclusions are limited to the reported models, corpus, repository, and task. The full method is in the <a href={withBase('/research/verifiable-web-artifacts.pdf')}>research paper (PDF)</a>.</p>
    </div>
    <MethodCaseStudies />
    <section class="article-body related-study" aria-labelledby="related-title">
      <h2 id="related-title">Related: a proposed architecture</h2>
      <p>A separate design study explores service boundaries, backpressure, idempotency, and outbox/inbox delivery for LLM evaluation. It is an architecture proposal, not a claim of production deployment.</p>
      <p><a class="text-link" href={withBase('/studies/eval-pipeline.html')}>Scaling out an LLM evaluation pipeline <Icon name="arrow-up-right" size={16} /></a></p>
    </section>
  </main>
  <SiteFooter name="Mrityunjay Kumar" year={new Date().getFullYear()} />
</Base>

<style>
  .related-study {
    margin: 40px 0 64px;
    padding-top: 8px;
    border-top: 1px solid var(--line-strong);
  }

  .text-link {
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 8px;
    min-height: 44px;
  }
</style>